<title>GREECE: RALLYING-GREEK RALLY LEADING POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-GREEK RALLY LEADING POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS, Greece 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions after four stages in the three-day Rally of Greece on Sunday:</p>
<p>  1. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru	   56:57</p>
<p>  2. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi	 56:59</p>
<p>  3. Juha Kankunnen (Finland) Ford		57:01</p>
<p>  4. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford		    57:08</p>
<p>  5. Richard Burns (Britain) Mitsubishi	 57:11</p>
<p>  6. Thomas Radstrom (Sweden) Toyota	    58:11</p>
<p>  7. Aris Vovos (Greece) Subaru		   59:35</p>
<p>  8. Uwe Nittel (Germany) Mitsubishi	    59:50</p>
<p>  9. Masao Kamioka (Japan) Subaru	     1:00:28</p>
<p> 10. Leonidas Kirkos (Greece) Ford	    1:00:32</p>
</text>
